                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/2001/08/036"} doi:10.1088/1126-6708/2001/08/036
          %p
            Its realization as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Penrose+limit"} Penrose limit
            of both the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-brane"} M2-brane
            solution
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi AdS
                    %mn 4
                  %mo ×
                  %msup
                    %mi S
                    %mn 7
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_4 \times S^7
            as well as the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            solution
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi AdS
                    %mn 7
                  %mo ×
                  %msup
                    %mi S
                    %mn 4
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_7 \times S^4
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#BlauFigueroaHullPapadopoulos02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthias+Blau"}> Matthias Blau
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jos%C3%A9+Figueroa-O%E2%80%99Farrill"} José Figueroa-O’Farrill
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christopher+Hull"} Christopher Hull
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Papadopoulos"} George Papadopoulos
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Penrose limits and maximal supersymmetry
                %strong 19
                (2002) L87-L95 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0201081"}> arXiv:hep-th/0201081
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/0264-9381/19/10/101"} doi:10.1088/0264-9381/19/10/101
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#BerensteinMaldacenaNastase02"} BMN 2002, §2
          %h3#EnhancementToSuperSpacetime pp-Wave Super spacetimes
          %p
            On the enhancement of pp-wave spacetimes to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+spacetimes"} super spacetimes
          %ul
            %li#DSV02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Keshav+Dasgupta"}> Keshav Dasgupta
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mohammad+M.+Sheikh-Jabbari"} Mohammad M. Sheikh-Jabbari
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Van+Raamsdonk"} Mark Van Raamsdonk
