                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mi q
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} AdS_p \times S^q
              spacetimes
            %p
              Dedicated discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pp-wave+spacetimes"} pp-wave spacetimes
              as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Penrose+limits"} Penrose limits
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/In%C3%B6n%C3%BC-Wigner+contractions"}> Inönü-Wigner contractions
              ) of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti+de+Sitter+spacetime"} AdSp
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/product+manifold"} x
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-sphere"} S^q
              spacetimes and of the corresponding limit of
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS-CFT+duality"} AdS-CFT duality
            %ul
              %li#BerensteinMaldacenaNastase02
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Berenstein"}> David Berenstein
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"} Juan Maldacena
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Horatiu+Nastase"} Horatiu Nastase
                  = succeed "," do
